 peer-to-peer allocation<br/>  ✓ Bilateral relationships<br/>  ✓ Fast, no consensus needed<br/><br/>Collective Trees:<br/>  ✓ Coalition decisions<br/>  ✓ Pooled resource allocation<br/>  ✓ Grant distributions<br/>  ✓ Governance compliance required
